\"mn\" transform=\"translate(24317.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(24817.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the weight of the body at an altitude of 3200 km above the Earth's surface is 8 N.</p>\n","qKey":"1ldyd2c7x","paperKey":"jee-main-2023-online-24th-january-morning-shift","exam":"jee-main"}]}